flowchart TD
 BUILD["npm workspace build / connector esbuild"] --> DIST["server dist + web dist / connector bundled dist"]
 DIST --> SETUP["CLI installRuntime: private home/runtime/version"]
 SETUP --> REGISTER["harness.register: 設定控え + 既存設定を保持"]
 REGISTER --> MCP["stdio MCP"]
 REGISTER --> HOOKS["Claude hook / Cursor bind / background receive"]
 MCP --> DAEMON["ensureDaemon / launchDaemon"]
 DAEMON --> LOCK["daemon.json lock + deliveries.json journal"]
 LOCK --> LOOP["SSE reconnect + 2秒queue照合 + 60秒sync"]
 LOOP -->|SIGTERM/SIGINT / 30分idle| STOP["lock解放・controller abort"]
 DIST --> MAIN["server main.ts: db/services/configを構築"]
 MAIN --> HTTP["Hono serve + static web"]
 MAIN --> JOB["hourly cleanup / callbridge periodic sync"]
 HTTP --> SIGNAL["SIGTERM/SIGINT"]
 SIGNAL --> CLOSE["shutdown.abort → SSE閉鎖 → server.close"]
 CLOSE --> DB["DB close / timeout強制close / exit"]
 UNINSTALL["CLI uninstall"] --> U["MCP/hook/instructions自分の部分のみ削除"]
 U --> REVOKE["daemon停止 / server接続解除 / config削除"]
 CI["CI 3OS×4harness preflight / browser / server image"] --> DIST
 TAG["connector-v tag"] --> PUBLISH["publish workflow: check/type/test/build/npm"]
